<Legal title="Cookie policy" description="How redbarn.ventures uses cookies and browser storage: essential storage, plus Google Analytics only if you accept. No advertising cookies." lead="Last updated 20 November 2026. The short version: no advertising cookies, and analytics cookies only if you say yes.">
  <section><h2>What cookies are</h2><p>Cookies are small text files that a website places on your device. Similar technologies, such as local storage and session storage, let a website remember small pieces of information in your browser. In this policy we use "cookies" to cover all of these.</p></section>
  <section><h2>What we use</h2><p>We keep cookie use to the minimum needed to run the website well. We use:</p><ul><li><b>Strictly necessary technical cookies</b> set by our hosting and security provider to deliver the site and protect it from abuse and attacks.</li><li><b>Session storage</b> to remember, for the length of your visit, that you have already seen the loading screen and how you arrived on a page, so animations are not repeated.</li><li><b>Local storage</b> to remember whether you have closed or answered our newsletter invitation, so we do not show it to you again too soon.</li></ul><p>None of these identify you personally, track you across other websites or are shared with advertisers.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Analytics cookies (only with your consent)</h2><p>If you click Accept on our cookie notice, we load Google Analytics 4 to understand which pages are useful and how visitors find us. Nothing from Google loads before you choose, and nothing loads if you decline.</p><ul><li><b>_ga</b> - distinguishes visitors. Expires after 2 years.</li><li><b>_ga_QSVG9MT6Q9</b> - keeps the state of a visit. Expires after 2 years.</li></ul><p>Advertising features, Google signals and ad personalisation are switched off. Google acts as our processor; see <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's privacy policy</a>.</p></section>
  <section><h2>What we do not use</h2><ul><li>No advertising or retargeting cookies.</li><li>No social media tracking pixels.</li><li>No cookies from font or content-delivery services - our fonts are hosted on our own servers.</li></ul></section>
  <section><h2>Your choice</h2><p>We remember your choice in your browser for six months. You can change it at any time with <a href="/cookies/" data-cc-open>Cookie settings</a>, also linked in the footer of every page. Declining removes our analytics cookies.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Links to other websites</h2><p>Some links on this website lead to other services, such as LinkedIn. When you visit those services, their own cookie policies apply. We recommend reviewing them.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Managing cookies</h2><p>You can block or delete cookies and browser storage at any time in your browser settings. Blocking strictly necessary cookies may affect how the website works. Clearing local storage means the newsletter invitation and the cookie notice may appear again.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Changes to this policy</h2><p>If we add any new analytics or marketing tool, we will update this policy first and ask for your consent where the law requires it. The date at the top of this page always shows the latest version.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about cookies or privacy can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${E}`}>{E}</a>. You can also read our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p></section>
</Legal>
